# NOTE: .env is intentionally NOT ignored here — it only holds PUBLIC_*
# build-time values (the Worker API base URL), which Vite inlines into the
# client bundle and are never secret. Keep real secrets in .dev.vars /
# `wrangler pages secret put` instead, never in a PUBLIC_ var.

